      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{59e59c1cda46f215cddef5f6|full_name}: Thanks for your detailed feedback. The new hub and some new updates in the coming weeks and months should help some of this. It's a very difficult problem to solve completely. I was just at Oculus Connect 4 and even veterans of MUD's and Secondlife giving a detailed talk on moderation are about where we are. We have a focus on moderation going on this week in terms of design and systems. I think we have some good ideas on how to help improve our systems. It might take a few patches to get there and it will be an ongoing process. I would also suggest blocking those that are being offensive. That way you can remain in the space.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
    {
