      "value": "@{59e59c1cda46f215cddef5f6|full_name}: Thanks for putting it so clearly. I look forward to real social consequences in social VR [what ever that finally looks like.] Also totally agree about community code of conduct that shows up and needs to be accepted before entering. Also maybe a rating on worlds like SL does? A NSFW/kids/sensitive folks troll hub might be really fun for some.",
