      "value": "@{58ce10aa9defe70849fb2d2c|full_name}: I would love that. If possible, a selection that appears right after logging in, that the user can select which world to go into, so we have less people jumping straight into the PG worlds with NSFW talk.\nI'm part of a Reddit/Discord group for female gamers, and the few times that VRChat has come up, it seems to almost always be talking about community-related problems, one of which is the disrespectful and/or sexual topics and avatars appearing common in the PG areas (like the hub).",
